a protein lactyltransferase that mediates lactylation of lysine residues in target proteins, such as CGAS (PubMed:39322678). Acts as an inhibitor of cGAS/STING signaling by catalyzing lactylation of CGAS, preventing the formation of liquid-like droplets in which CGAS is activated (PubMed:39322678)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}